{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ecf46430914ccf6f","type":"group","x":-890,"y":-951,"width":3996,"height":5529,"label":"02-Flash Attention"},
		{"id":"06b68b4e79c3af8f","type":"group","x":506,"y":-354,"width":1367,"height":3989,"color":"1","label":"1. Tiling  分块计算局部Attention分数"},
		{"id":"96315fb7c0204db2","type":"group","x":-890,"y":-3520,"width":1998,"height":1960,"label":"01-标准Attention"},
		{"id":"e577dbb367662973","type":"group","x":-468,"y":632,"width":790,"height":3003,"color":"3","label":"2. Online Softmax：跨块归一化，得到O矩阵"},
		{"id":"1395a896f415e04f","type":"text","text":"1 中间矩阵规模大，矩阵S和P的尺寸都是N x N，存储需求随着序列的长度呈平方级增长","x":-350,"y":-1960,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"5c8fe8013ebc7245","type":"text","text":"2 HBM读写开销大，朴素的attention实现需要反复读写中间矩阵，导致大量数据搬运，可能形成显存带宽瓶颈","x":-50,"y":-1960,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"a5f8f807d56935f5","type":"text","text":"标准Attention带来以下问题：","x":-310,"y":-2120,"width":480,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fdb959f39ac22cd5","type":"text","text":"解决方案：FlashAttention  使用分块计算(Tiling), online softmax 和 Kernel Fusion，尽量在片上高速储存中完成中间计算，避免将完整S，P写入HBM，从而降低显存读写开销","x":-310,"y":-1720,"width":480,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"68c4c58723bafec5","type":"text","text":"###### ③ 计算 Attention 输出矩阵 O\n\n使用 P 对 Value（V）向量进行加权求和，得到 矩阵O。每一行都是对应 Query Token 汇总信息后生成的新表示。\n\n$$\n[ O=PV ]\n$$","x":-310,"y":-2380,"width":480,"height":180},
		{"id":"42800774815459fc","type":"text","text":"把整个P矩阵写回HBM","x":-810,"y":-2580,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"be8c0a4f8469a016","type":"text","text":"从HBM中读取P，与V相乘","x":-810,"y":-2460,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0d07630e42a6eed8","type":"text","text":"###### ① 计算注意力分数矩阵 S\nQuery（Q）与 Key（K）进行缩放点积，得到注意力分数矩阵 S，表示每个 Query Token 与各 Key Token 的匹配程度。\n\n$$\n[ S=\\frac{QK^\\top}{\\sqrt{d_k}} ]\n$$","x":-310,"y":-3180,"width":480,"height":200},
		{"id":"1e69c6751ca3cd87","type":"text","text":"###### ② 计算注意力权重矩阵 P\n\n对 S 的每一行进行 Softmax 归一化，得到 P，表示每个 Query 对其允许关注的各 Key 所对应 Value 向量分配的加权系数。\n\n$$\n[ P=\\operatorname{softmax}(S) ]\n$$","x":-310,"y":-2780,"width":480,"height":180},
		{"id":"c96a36339c6025f9","type":"text","text":"把整个S写入HBM","x":313,"y":-2960,"width":245,"height":60},
		{"id":"b201243b677eb2bd","type":"text","text":"从HBM读取S计算Softmax","x":313,"y":-2860,"width":245,"height":60},
		{"id":"10126067f8dc310e","type":"text","text":"标准attention\n\nS -> P -> O","x":-310,"y":-3340,"width":480,"height":80},
		{"id":"366aa3d885280f21","type":"text","text":"将 Q和K/V 沿 Token（序列长度）维度分成小块","x":1031,"y":-318,"width":316,"height":86},
		{"id":"692c1cc335ad6193","type":"text","text":"按需应用Casual/Padding Mask","x":1031,"y":534,"width":316,"height":90},
		{"id":"1529842685a7281d","type":"text","text":"接口 A：接收<br/>S_block、V_block、is_last","x":-163,"y":690,"width":316,"height":257},
		{"id":"21b8ea5b396d5eb9","type":"text","text":"完成Attention输出O，即完成FlashAttention前向计算","x":960,"y":3357,"width":250,"height":92},
		{"id":"d740568fcb7ca0cb","type":"text","text":"接口 A：交付<br/>S_block、V_block、is_last","x":1031,"y":686,"width":316,"height":257},
		{"id":"cdcc233f081baf5a","type":"text","text":"`S_block`：当前块的 Attention Scores","x":1506,"y":686,"width":365,"height":75},
		{"id":"b779e9e0234738d2","type":"text","text":"`V_block`：当前块对应的 Value","x":1506,"y":780,"width":365,"height":70},
		{"id":"89dc0457506ddda0","type":"text","text":"`is_last`：当前是否为最后一个 K/V Block","x":1506,"y":866,"width":365,"height":77},
		{"id":"9b8dd89c82dd627a","type":"text","text":"Step2：计算修正系数α，$$\n\\alpha=\\exp(m_{\\mathrm{old}}-m_{\\mathrm{new}})\n$$","x":-163,"y":1253,"width":316,"height":102},
		{"id":"d4497055d5cec89a","type":"text","text":"Step 3：计算当前指数块$$\n p=\\exp\\big(S_{\\mathrm{block}}-m_{\\mathrm{new}}[:,\\mathrm{None}]\\big)\n$$","x":-163,"y":1433,"width":316,"height":99},
		{"id":"ae203a37d0c3afc8","type":"text","text":"Step 4：更新$$\n\\ell_{\\mathrm{new}}=\\alpha\\odot\\ell_{\\mathrm{old}}+\\operatorname{rowsum}(p)\n$$","x":-163,"y":1611,"width":316,"height":99},
		{"id":"8537b9e939a8fb2b","type":"text","text":"Step 5：更新$$\na_{\\mathrm{new}}=\\alpha[:,\\mathrm{None}]\\odot a_{\\mathrm{old}}+pV_{\\mathrm{block}}\n$$","x":-163,"y":1776,"width":316,"height":99},
		{"id":"b0b04bb02cd05dbc","type":"text","text":"Step 1：逐行更新$$\nm_{\\mathrm{new}}=\\max\\big(m_{\\mathrm{old}},\\operatorname{rowmax}(S_{\\mathrm{block}})\\big)\n$$","x":-163,"y":1060,"width":316,"height":105},
		{"id":"c2c72cbcd5a54b3c","type":"text","text":"对于当前固定的 Q Block，是否已经遍历完所有 K/V Block？","x":-163,"y":1968,"width":316,"height":108},
		{"id":"32f7f93d8c31b975","type":"text","text":"最终按行归一化$$\nO_{\\mathrm{block}}=a/\\ell[:,\\mathrm{None}]\n$$","x":-288,"y":2230,"width":250,"height":114},
		{"id":"32d97121c593cea7","type":"text","text":"接口 B：\n返回更新后的 m、ℓ、a","x":28,"y":2230,"width":250,"height":114},
		{"id":"6801d5dc4a502753","type":"text","text":"接口 B：\n接收并保留更新后的 m、ℓ、a","x":661,"y":2452,"width":250,"height":114},
		{"id":"56e5c0125133644d","type":"text","text":"接口 C：\n返回最终 O_block","x":-288,"y":2772,"width":250,"height":114},
		{"id":"a33ba47725f75c5c","type":"text","text":"接口 C：\n接收最终O_block，Tiling将O_block写回HBM","x":661,"y":2772,"width":250,"height":114},
		{"id":"14b72de26a8dda16","type":"text","text":"是否还有未处理的Q Block","x":960,"y":3035,"width":250,"height":136},
		{"id":"d055a3dad945f975","type":"text","text":"### 固定一个 Query 块，从HBM上读取到片上存储（SRAM）","x":1031,"y":-182,"width":316,"height":80},
		{"id":"3e071d44106a1fe2","type":"text","text":"仅在新Q Block开始时初始化：\n\n1. m = −∞\n2. ℓ = 0\n3. a = 0","x":1031,"y":-53,"width":316,"height":155},
		{"id":"24989712690f1539","type":"text","text":"读取K Block和V Block，并加载到片上存储","x":1031,"y":190,"width":316,"height":93},
		{"id":"1e651f5b0e3230a0","type":"text","text":"计算当前块的局部Attention分数，\n$$\nS_{\\text{block}} = \\frac{Q_{\\text{block}}K_{\\text{block}}^{T}}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\n$$","x":1031,"y":350,"width":316,"height":110},
		{"id":"5aa7e2a1390d905d","type":"text","text":"1. m： 运行最大值\n2. $\\ell$：归一化分母\n3. $a$：未归一化的输出累积值","x":1456,"y":-53,"width":321,"height":155},
		{"id":"99b010186995e9a2","x":371,"y":-1751,"width":624,"height":131,"type":"text","text":"Tiling 和 Online Softmax 相互配合，建立了一套无需物化完整 Attention Scores 和 Softmax 权重矩阵的分块计算方法。Kernel Fusion 进一步将局部矩阵乘法、在线归一化和输出累积融合到同一个 GPU Kernel 中，从而减少 HBM 读写与 Kernel 启动开销。"},
		{"id":"70cce2688972501a","x":-496,"y":4044,"width":2367,"height":172,"type":"text","text":"**FlashAttention 的算子融合，就是在一个 GPU 前向 Kernel 中，通过 Tiling 的分块循环，将局部矩阵乘法、Online Softmax 和输出累积连续执行。这样可以复用片上数据及状态，避免物化完整的 S、P 矩阵，减少 HBM 读写开销。**"}
	],
